# Supabase-first workflow

- Do not use dummy data or local mocks in the app.
- Use `supabase` from `src/lib/supabaseClient.ts` for all queries.
- Keep auth profile data in `public.profiles` and rely on `profiles.role` for roles.
- Add schema changes via new SQL migrations in `supabase/migrations/`.
- Prefer `resolveImageUrl` for images and keep bucket names consistent:
  - `restaurants`, `menu-items`, `avatars`.
